                         S O K O B A N

Push every box onto a storage spot. You can push one box at a time;
you cannot pull boxes or push them through a wall or another box.

Movement:
  h / j / k / l       Left / down / up / right
  Arrow keys          Move in the indicated direction
  H / J / K / L       Run and push in that direction
  Ctrl-H/J/K/L        Run until an object blocks the way

Undo and restart:
  u                   Undo the last move/push
  U                   Restart the current level

Other commands:
  ?                   Show this help
  Ctrl-R              Redraw the board
  q                   Quit the game
+= (PAGE BREAK)
                     TEMPORARY CHECKPOINTS

  c or s              Remember the current board
  r or Ctrl-U         Return to that checkpoint

A checkpoint is kept only in memory. It is not a saved game on disk
and is lost when you quit. Entering a level creates its first checkpoint.

Use a checkpoint when you are happy with your progress but want to try
some uncertain moves. Restore it if you get stuck, or use U to start over.

The status line shows the level, boxes, boxes on storage spots, moves,
and pushes. Completing a level automatically starts the next one.

Run SOKOBAN with a level number to start there, for example: SOKOBAN 5.

Help does not change the board, counters, checkpoint, or undo state.
== (END)
